M-PIN OFFICIAL RELEASE NOTICE

The M-PIN documents published through the official M-PIN repository

constitute the official M-PIN specification releases.

Copies of the official documents may be redistributed in accordance

with CC BY-ND 4.0.

Modified, translated, extended, adapted, or derivative versions

created by third parties are not official M-PIN releases and must not

be represented as official M-PIN specifications.

Only documents explicitly published by the M-PIN Project through its

official release process may be represented as official M-PIN

specifications.

This license applies to the documentation and specification materials

contained in this repository unless a specific file explicitly states

otherwise.
